", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rLt6P-bCDHQQ7kNvwEyAHZv&_nc_oc=AdrM07E4HlKxf-9mcAftV3e7SLsfZQiurXa8E9Y8L9Mmw2Ca--2MasUBJiaJIp13_ag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af07wDavpx6THps4j_7Fub-0CHNwN-d47JymQglKOFDT6A&oe=69D3B779"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WTNCRuxOBMgQ7kNvwGpEMt6&_nc_oc=AdoVRtuxmSIWDEF46UcZVfT23hiE-kpF1r23xLGkc6UZzuTTonoyxbJz3VeZoQj5gpQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af31RgbbVarw_MbRC36H54zfxLsDUmQm5dA0K-qD1msLMw&oe=69D3960B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9vJhD-gQeDYQ7kNvwFjuXZO&_nc_oc=AdoLe6b8K0N3hrSmy0hT_ifFJSl_os7IZ7C2fLHmy2i-gouWbm9scZ4zqp3PgAxgHQg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2_nvLIaSkw3IkI4elaq_oMHcsudQjsIwzXOXLvvB1_mQ&oe=69D3948E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel